OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786745070
OL,3,CPolice dig up car church park 34 years
OL,4,Cafter woman disappeared
OL,6,FPolice have carried out excavations
OL,7,Fnear a church in Leeds after receiving
OL,8,F"recent information" about the
OL,9,Fdisappearance of a woman 34 years ago.
OL,11,FOfficers from West Yorkshire Police's
OL,12,Fcold case team conducted
OL,13,Finvestigations in the car park of the
OL,14,FMoravian Church in Fulneck, Pudsey, in
OL,15,Fconnection with the inquiry into
OL,16,Fmissing Patricia Hall.
OL,18,FThe mother-of-two vanished in 1992 at
OL,19,Fthe age of 39. Her body has never been
OL,20,Ffound.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/6
