PN,33602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786745070
OL,3,CPolice dig up car church park 34 years
OL,4,Cafter woman disappeared
OL,6,FA force spokesperson said the search
OL,7,Fover the weekend followed "recent
OL,8,Finformation received by the team".
OL,10,FOn Monday the force said it had
OL,11,Fconcluded the search and "nothing of
OL,12,Fnote" had been found.
OL,14,FMrs Hall was last seen on 25 January
OL,15,F1992 when her family spent the day in
OL,16,FRipon.
OL,18,FDespite her body never being found, an
OL,19,Finquest into her death opened in April
OL,20,Fthis year.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
