CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786745070
OL,3,CPolice dig up car church park 34 years
OL,4,Cafter woman disappeared
OL,6,FCoroner Oliver Longstaff said there
OL,7,Fhad been no sightings of her and no
OL,8,F"circumstantial evidence" she is
OL,9,Falive, including no attempts to use
OL,10,Fher bank accounts.
OL,12,FMr Longstaff said: "There is reason to
OL,13,Fsuspect that Mrs Hall's abrupt and
OL,14,Fcomplete disappearance is a
OL,15,Fconsequence of her having died a
OL,16,Fviolent or unnatural death."
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@YO]tD@TOUxD@\O]
