OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786745070
OL,3,CPolice dig up car church park 34 years
OL,4,Cafter woman disappeared
OL,6,FMrs Hall's husband Keith Hall was
OL,7,Fcharged with murder after he allegedly
OL,8,Fadmitted the crime on tape to an
OL,9,Fundercover policewoman, with whom he
OL,10,Fhad started a romance.
OL,12,FHe allegedly told her that he had
OL,13,Fstrangled his wife and disposed of her
OL,14,Fbody in an incinerator.
OL,16,FBut a judge at his 1994 trial, the
OL,17,Fjudge ruled the tape, which was
OL,18,Fobtained after Keith Hall answered a
OL,19,F"lonely hearts" advertisement in a
OL,20,Flocal newspaper, was inadmissible as
OL,21,Fevidence.
OL,26,@{D@AOU{D@OO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/6
