CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786745070
OL,3,CPolice dig up car church park 34 years
OL,4,Cafter woman disappeared
OL,6,FFollowing the latest developments
OL,7,FAssistant Chief Constable Sarah Jones
OL,8,Fsaid Mrs Hall's family had been
OL,9,Finformed about the dig.
OL,11,F"We obviously have a duty to act on
OL,12,Fany new information we receive," she
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,F"The Major Investigation Review Team
OL,16,Fcarried out a thorough cold case
OL,17,Freview into Patricia's disappearance
OL,18,Fwhich concluded last year without
OL,19,Festablishing any new lines of enquiry.
OL,26,@sD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/6
